<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>WHITE STARS</title>

<script src="https://telegram.org/js/telegram-web-app.js"></script>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
}

body{

background:#ffffff;
color:#111;

}

.container{

max-width:460px;
margin:auto;
padding:20px;

}

.logo{

font-size:34px;
font-weight:800;
text-align:center;
margin-top:20px;

}

.subtitle{

margin-top:8px;
text-align:center;
color:#777;
font-size:15px;

}

.balance{

margin-top:28px;

background:#f5f5f7;

border-radius:22px;

padding:22px;

box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.05);

}

.balance-title{

font-size:14px;

color:#777;

}

.balance-value{

font-size:34px;

font-weight:700;

margin-top:8px;

}

.topup{

width:100%;

height:54px;

border:none;

margin-top:18px;

background:black;

color:white;

font-size:17px;

font-weight:700;

border-radius:15px;

cursor:pointer;

transition:.25s;

}

.topup:hover{

transform:scale(.98);

}

.section{

margin-top:35px;

}

.section h2{

font-size:20px;

margin-bottom:15px;

}

.cards{

display:grid;

grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;

gap:14px;

}

.card{

background:#f5f5f7;

border-radius:18px;

padding:18px;

cursor:pointer;

transition:.2s;

}

.card:hover{

transform:translateY(-3px);

}

.card-icon{

font-size:28px;

}

.card-title{

margin-top:12px;

font-size:17px;

font-weight:700;

}

.card-text{

margin-top:8px;

font-size:14px;

color:#666;

line-height:20px;

}

.links{

margin-top:35px;

background:#f5f5f7;

border-radius:20px;

overflow:hidden;

}

.link{

display:flex;

justify-content:space-between;

align-items:center;

padding:18px;

border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;

cursor:pointer;

transition:.2s;

}

.link:last-child{

border:none;

}

.link:hover{

background:#ececec;

}

.arrow{

color:#999;

font-size:20px;

}

.footer{

margin:35px 0;

text-align:center;

font-size:13px;

color:#999;

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<div class="logo">

⭐ WHITE STARS

</div>

<div class="subtitle">

Покупка цифровых товаров Telegram

</div>

<div class="balance">

<div class="balance-title">

Баланс аккаунта

</div>

<div class="balance-value">

0.00 ₽

</div>

<button class="topup" onclick="topup()">

Пополнить баланс

</button>

</div>

<div class="section">

<h2>

Каталог

</h2>

<div class="cards">

<div class="card">

<div class="card-icon">

⭐

</div>

<div class="card-title">

Telegram Stars

</div>

<div class="card-text">

Покупка звезд Telegram по выгодному курсу.

</div>

</div>

<div class="card">

<div class="card-icon">

👑

</div>

<div class="card-title">

Telegram Premium

</div>

<div class="card-text">

Покупка Premium на любой аккаунт.

</div>

</div>

<div class="card">

<div class="card-icon">

🎁

</div>

<div class="card-title">

Telegram Gifts

</div>

<div class="card-text">

Покупка подарков Telegram.

</div>

</div>

<div class="card">

<div class="card-icon">

🖼

</div>

<div class="card-title">

NFT

</div>

<div class="card-text">

NFT Fragment и другие цифровые товары.

</div>

</div>

</div>

